1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:02,613
(Raj:)Really? Us gonna tell him?

2
00:00:02,781 --> 00:00:04,821
SHELDON:
Who's going to tell whom about what?

3
00:00:04,992 --> 00:00:06,912
Sheldon. Hey. Hi.

4
00:00:07,369 --> 00:00:10,829
(Sheldon:)Your surprise confuses me. I live here.

5
00:00:12,291 --> 00:00:13,331
(Howard:)Right.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,040
(Howard:)So, listen, what are you doing
tomorrow afternoon?

7
00:00:17,212 --> 00:00:19,672
(Sheldon:)-Be more specific.
-Four-thirty.

8
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,380
(Sheldon:)That's not afternoon. That's preevning.

9
00:00:23,427 --> 00:00:25,967
(Penny:)-What?
-It's a time of day I invented.

10
00:00:26,138 --> 00:00:28,468
(Sheldon:)It better defines the ambiguous period...

11
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:32,020
...between afternoon and evening:
preevning.

12
00:00:32,185 --> 00:00:35,775
(Sheldon:)Fairly certain it will catch on
as it fills a desperate need.

13
00:00:36,273 --> 00:00:38,863
(Raj:)Right, okay. What are you doing
tomorrow preevning?

14
00:00:39,026 --> 00:00:42,816
(Sheldon:)Well, tomorrow's Saturday.
Saturday night is laundry night.

15
00:00:42,988 --> 00:00:47,698
(Sheldon:)So I'll be spending the preevning
pre-sorting and pre-soaking.

16
00:00:47,868 --> 00:00:49,828
Okay, what if I were to tell you...

17
00:00:49,995 --> 00:00:52,125
...tomorrow at 4:30,
you could meet a woman...

18
00:00:52,289 --> 00:00:55,879
...who has been scientifically chosen
to be your perfect mate?

19
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:59,210
(Sheldon:)I would snort in derision
and throw my arms in the air...

